title: mf_schema
tags: [[Reserved field]] Schema
kind: reference
summary: A type of the metarecord, one row per type: the schema checks the fields the type requires.

Each row names a type the user schema defines; a write that leaves a typed metarecord
violating its type is refused with the list of violations ([[Schema]]). The daemon
writes it once of its own accord, on the duplicate groups it creates
(`duplicate_group`, [[Duplicate groups]]).
